  - isEndpoint: 0
    id: 1
    nextNodeID: 2
    text: The smith spoke earlier of a commission from the King... Was it Mother's
      brooch that required mending?
    choices: []
    updateSpeakerInfo: 1
    speakerName: Ceryx
    leftSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 65d50137d10f0444c82703dc57f2fdd2, type: 3}
    rightSprite: {fileID: 0}
  - isEndpoint: 1
    id: 2
    nextNodeID: 
    text: When the time comes, I shall discover the truth. Mother... By the gods,
      I swear I shall unveil the one who wrought this crime and avenge your death.
    choices: []
